OL,3,GNEWSAWhat happens next after police
OL,4,Aforce downgrade?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA national team of experts will support
OL,7,Fstruggling Devon and Cornwall Police,
OL,8,Fbut improvements will not come as a
OL,9,F"quick fix", a Chief Constable warned.
OL,11,FThe force was downgraded in September
OL,12,Ffrom a Level Two to Level Three after
OL,13,Finspectors ruled that public safety was
OL,14,Fbeing put at risk due to failure to
OL,15,Finvestigate crime and protect victims.
OL,17,FA national team, including the Home
OL,18,FOffice and police commissioner, will
OL,19,Fnow support the force to introduce
OL,20,Fimprovements.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
