OL,3,GNEWSAWhat happens next after police
OL,4,Aforce downgrade?
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief Constable James Vaughan added
OL,7,Fthat his team had "doubled down" and he
OL,8,Fwas "absolutely confident" the force
OL,9,Fwill get to where it needs to be.
